  "label": "Donald Trump",
  "description": "The phrase 'tough president' in the bottom text is a direct reference to Donald Trump, who was the 45th President of the United States (2017–2021) and known for his hardline, confrontational approach to immigration policy, including his rhetoric and policies targeting Mexico and Central American migrants. The meme uses Trump as a symbolic figure to represent the 'toughness' that supposedly forces Mexico to engage, which is a real-world political context.",
